        "faq_1": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are Hague Protect formulas safe for all shoe materials?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Our formulas are pH-balanced and made for premium footwear materials including leather, suede, nubuck, mesh, canvas, nylon, vinyl, and rubber. For delicate napped leathers like suede and nubuck, use a soft brush and follow the care steps on the product page.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_2": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What makes Hague Protect different from regular cleaners?",
            "answer": "<p>Hague Protect is built for sneakers and premium footwear — not generic household cleaners. Our cleaning and protection systems are material-specific, non-toxic when used as directed, and designed to clean without stripping color or damaging finishes.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_3": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I use the Shield Guard / protective coating?",
            "answer": "<p>Clean the shoe first, let it dry fully, then apply Shield Guard evenly and allow it to cure for about 24 hours before wear. Once cured, it helps repel water, mud, and everyday stains. For best results, reapply about once a month with regular use.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_4": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long does the protective coating last?",
            "answer": "<p>With correct application and curing, protection typically lasts 4 to 6 weeks under normal daily wear. Heavy rain, mud, or frequent cleaning may shorten that window — a light touch-up keeps performance strong.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_5": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I use Hague Protect on suede and nubuck?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Use our suede/nubuck-safe products and tools only. Avoid soaking, scrubbing hard, or using formulas meant only for smooth leather. Pair with a Premium Suede Brush and always test on a small hidden area first.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_6": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long does delivery take in India?",
            "answer": "<p>Orders placed before 12pm IST on business days usually ship the same day. Delivery across India typically takes 2 to 5 business days depending on your location. You’ll receive tracking once the order is dispatched.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_7": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you ship internationally?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, international shipping is available on eligible orders. Overseas delivery usually takes about 7 to 12 business days after dispatch, depending on customs and destination.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_8": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is your returns and refund policy?",
            "answer": "<p>We want you to be confident in your care kit. Eligible unopened products can be returned within the stated trial window for a refund. Opened or used products may not qualify — contact support with your order number and we’ll guide you.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_9": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Which care kit should I buy for my sneakers?",
            "answer": "<p>Match the kit to your material: leather kits for smooth leather, suede/nubuck kits for napped finishes, fabric kits for mesh and canvas, and soles kits for outsole and midsole cleaning. If you’re unsure, message us on WhatsApp with a photo of your shoes.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_10": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you offer wholesale or corporate gifting?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Hague Protect supports bulk, wholesale, and corporate gifting with custom kit options. Reach out through Corporate Gifting or WhatsApp with quantity and timeline and our team will help.</p>"
          }
        },
