            "question": "What is the best sneaker cleaner in India?",
            "answer": "<p>Hague Protect is one of India's most trusted sneaker cleaners, rated 4.9 by over 10,000 customers. Its natural, material-safe formula cleans leather, suede, mesh and canvas, and was engineered specifically for Indian dust, rain and daily wear.</p>"
